sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Renderer
  participant IPC as runChat (main)
  participant DB as SQLite
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant AI as Provider
  participant T as Tools
  UI->>IPC: chat:send
  IPC->>IPC: resolve provider, model, key
  IPC->>DB: load history, save user message
  IPC->>IPC: prepareConversation (trim to context window)
  IPC->>O: run(conversation)
  loop until the answer is complete
    O->>AI: request (system prompt + tools)
    AI-->>O: text / tool calls
    O->>T: execute tool (ask the user first if it mutates)
    T-->>O: tool result
  end
  O-->>IPC: stream events, finished messages
  IPC-->>UI: chat:stream-event (text, tools, usage, stop)
  IPC->>DB: save messages, queue for memory index
